  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tSelf Assessment \n\t\tSelf Assessment FAQs\n\n### Self Assessment -Capital Gains Tax Adjustment (CGT Box 51)\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 27 Nov, 2025 at  2:57 PM\n\n\t\tAccording to the information entered on the Capital Gains page, the system will automatically calculate the tax liability in line with HMRC guidelines. We kindly request you to review and update the relevant boxes in the CGT supplementary form, enter the required details, and save the changes.\n\nOnce this is done, please check the SA302 computation and Box 51. If you need any further assistance, please refer to the below HMRC notes and help guide. \n\nWe appreciate your attention to these details and look forward to assisting you further. If you have any additional queries, please let us know!\n\nhttps://www.gov.uk/guidance/work-out-your-capital-gains-tax-adjustment-for-the-2024-to-2025-tax-yearhttps://capium.freshdesk.com/support/solutions/articles/9000268723-capital-gains-calculator-post-budget-30-october-2024\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115347\">Self Assessment </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188547\">Self Assessment FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Self Assessment -Capital Gains Tax Adjustment (CGT Box 51)\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Thu, 27 Nov, 2025 at  2:57 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"356\" data-start=\"60\">According to the information entered on the Capital Gains page, the system will automatically calculate the tax liability in line with HMRC guidelines. We kindly request you to review and update the relevant boxes in the CGT supplementary form, enter the required details, and save the changes.</p><p data-end=\"356\" data-start=\"60\"><br></p><p data-end=\"495\" data-start=\"358\" dir=\"ltr\">Once this is done, please check the SA302 computation and Box 51. If you need any further assistance, please refer to the below HMRC notes and help guide.&nbsp;</p><p data-end=\"495\" data-start=\"358\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">We appreciate your attention to these details and look forward to assisting you further. If you have any additional queries, please let us know!</p><div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></div><div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/work-out-your-capital-gains-tax-adjustment-for-the-2024-to-2025-tax-year\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(44, 92, 197); text-decoration: none; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.gov.uk/guidance/work-out-your-capital-gains-tax-adjustment-for-the-2024-to-2025-tax-year</a></div><div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></div><div style=\"box-s